    "answer": {
      "short": "$94.81\\,\\text{cm}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}r&=\\frac{9}{2}\\\\r&=4.5\\,\\text{cm}\\\\A_1&=9\\times7\\\\A_1&=63\\\\A_2&=\\frac12\\pi(4.5)^2\\\\A_{\\text{Total}}&=63+\\frac{81\\pi}{8}\\\\A_{\\text{Total}}&\\approx94.81\\,\\text{cm}^2\\end{align*}$$",
